{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"个性化运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"exploration-exploitation","title":"探索与利用策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/operations/exploration-exploitation","wordCount":2085,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"cold-start-strategies","title":"冷启动策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/operations/cold-start-strategies","wordCount":2058,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"personalization-metrics","title":"个性化指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/operations/personalization-metrics","wordCount":2321,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"个性化运营\">个性化运营</h1><h2 id=\"本章概览\">本章概览</h2><p>高质量的个性化引擎不是一次性建造完成的，而是通过持续的实验、优化和迭代不断演进。本章聚焦个性化引擎的运营闭环：如何在推荐中平衡已知偏好的利用和未知机会的探索、如何解决新用户/新商品的冷启动问题、以及如何通过科学的指标体系和 A/B 测试持续衡量和改进个性化效果。</p>\n<p>本章包含三篇文档：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"exploration-exploitation\">探索与利用策略</a>：Bandit 算法族在电商个性化中的理论与实践</li>\n<li><a href=\"cold-start-strategies\">冷启动策略</a>：新用户、新商品、新场景三类冷启动问题的解决方案</li>\n<li><a href=\"personalization-metrics\">个性化指标体系</a>：从用户满意度到商业价值的完整评估体系</li>\n</ul>\n"}